{"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/yorkie\/client\/resync(_:discardlocalchanges:initialpresence:)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"metadata":{"title":"resync(_:discardLocalChanges:initialPresence:)","modules":[{"name":"Yorkie"}],"extendedModule":"Yorkie","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"resync"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Document","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Yorkie8DocumentC"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"discardLocalChanges"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Bool","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"initialPresence"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"PresenceData","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Yorkie12PresenceDataa"},{"kind":"text","text":"?) "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"async"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"throws"},{"kind":"text","text":" -> ["},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"DroppedChange","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Yorkie13DroppedChangeV"},{"kind":"text","text":"]"}],"externalID":"s:6Yorkie6ClientC6resync_19discardLocalChanges15initialPresenceSayAA13DroppedChangeVGAA8DocumentC_SbSDySSSe_SEpGSgtYaKF","roleHeading":"Instance Method","symbolKind":"method"},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie","doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie\/Client"]]},"sections":[],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Recovers a document whose local writes the server has refused, without dropping the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"client and the "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie\/Document"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"@discardableResult","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"@","kind":"attribute"},{"text":"MainActor","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"resync","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"_","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"doc","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Document","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie\/Document","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Yorkie8DocumentC"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"discardLocalChanges","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Bool","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"initialPresence","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"PresenceData","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie\/PresenceData","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Yorkie12PresenceDataa"},{"text":"? = nil) ","kind":"text"},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" -> [","kind":"text"},{"text":"DroppedChange","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie\/DroppedChange","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Yorkie13DroppedChangeV"},{"text":"]","kind":"text"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"parameters":[{"name":"doc","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The attached document to recover.","type":"text"}]}]},{"name":"discardLocalChanges","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Must be ","type":"text"},{"code":"true","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". The un-pushed changes are taken out of the queue","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and returned instead of being sent again; there is no non-discarding form, and the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"argument keeps the data loss visible at the call site."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The presence to re-attach with. Defaults to the document’s current"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"presence, so the user keeps their cursor: presence is not what the server refused."}]}],"name":"initialPresence"}],"kind":"parameters"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"return-value","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Return Value"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The discarded changes, so the app can report them. Re-applying them is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"deliberately not the default.","type":"text"}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"discussion","level":2,"text":"Discussion","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"An auth webhook that starts denying writes mid-session (a locked document, a member"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"downgraded to read-only, a revoked share link) leaves the refused changes in the queue."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Push and pull share one RPC, so every later sync re-sends them, is denied again, and the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"client stops receiving other peers’ changes too. The refused changes cannot be undone in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"place either: they are already applied to the root and there is no server-confirmed copy"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to fall back on. Recovery therefore re-anchors the same "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie\/Document"},{"type":"text","text":" instance on the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"server state:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Wait out any in-flight sync, then drop offline persistence and take the un-pushed"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"changes out of the queue."}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Detach without the presence-clear change a detach normally mints, so the pack carries"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"no changes a webhook could refuse and the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"clientSeq"},{"type":"text","text":" counter never has to be rewound."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Reset the document for re-anchoring and attach it again under the sync mode, garbage","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"collection option and poll interval it had, with the presence it held.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Restart the sync loop that the denial stopped."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"orderedList"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Keeping the instance is the point: the app’s subscriptions and the editor bound to the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"document survive. Between the discard and the re-anchor the queue has a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"clientSeq"},{"type":"text","text":" hole"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"no new change may be minted over, so the discard suspends minting: "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie\/Document\/update(_:_:)"},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie\/Document\/undo()"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie\/Document\/redo()"},{"type":"text","text":" throw "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"YorkieError\/Code\/errRefused"},{"type":"text","text":" and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie\/Document\/isMintable","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" is "},{"code":"false","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" until the re-anchor. An edit made before the discard is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"part of the discarded set and is reported with the rest."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A detach the server refuses restores the queue and leaves the document attached as it was,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"so the call can be retried. Offline persistence is the exception, as in yorkie-js-sdk: it","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"is torn down before the detach and stays down until the next attach. Past the detach the changes are gone for good and are published","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"as a ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie\/LocalChangesDroppedEvent","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" with reason ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie\/LocalChangesDroppedValue\/Reason-swift.enum\/writeDenied","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":",","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"before the re-attach, which can still fail.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If a teardown or another detach takes the document over while the detach is in flight,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"or the app attaches it again before the re-anchor, the recovery stops there: the changes"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"are still reported as dropped, but the document is neither re-anchored nor re-attached,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and the call throws."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The whole recovery runs under the client’s sync semaphore, so no sync can start or be in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"flight while the queue is touched.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Automatic recovery on attach denials and watch denials is not part of this call."}]},{"style":"note","name":"Throws","type":"aside","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":""},{"code":"YorkieError\/Code\/errClientNotActivated","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" when the client is not active or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"loses its session during the detach, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"YorkieError\/Code\/errNotAttached"},{"type":"text","text":" when the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"document is not attached or another call detaches it during the detach,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"YorkieError\/Code\/errNotDetached"},{"type":"text","text":" when the document is attached again before the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"re-anchor,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"YorkieError\/Code\/errInvalidArgument"},{"type":"text","text":" when "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"discardLocalChanges"},{"type":"text","text":" is "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"false"},{"type":"text","text":", or the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"error of the detach or the re-attach."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie\/Client\/resync(_:discardLocalChanges:initialPresence:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"references":{"doc://Yorkie/documentation/Yorkie/Document/redo()":{"url":"\/documentation\/yorkie\/document\/redo()","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"redo","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"() ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie\/Document\/redo()","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","role":"symbol","title":"redo()","abstract":[{"code":"redo","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" redoes the last undone change made to the document by the local client."}]},"doc://Yorkie/documentation/Yorkie/Document/undo()":{"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"code":"undo","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" undoes the last change made to the document by the local client."}],"title":"undo()","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"undo","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"() ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie\/Document\/undo()","url":"\/documentation\/yorkie\/document\/undo()"},"doc://Yorkie/documentation/Yorkie/Client":{"url":"\/documentation\/yorkie\/client","title":"Client","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Client"}],"abstract":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Client"},{"type":"text","text":" is a normal client that can communicate with the server."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"It has documents and sends changes of the documents in local"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to the server to synchronize with other replicas in remote."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie\/Client","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Client"}],"type":"topic","kind":"symbol"},"doc://Yorkie/documentation/Yorkie/Document/update(_:_:)":{"url":"\/documentation\/yorkie\/document\/update(_:_:)","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"update","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"((","kind":"text"},{"text":"JSONObject","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Yorkie10JSONObjectC","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"inout","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Presence","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Yorkie8PresenceC","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Void","preciseIdentifier":"s:s4Voida","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","preciseIden